# Agent audit output — working notes, not part of the library
docs/audits/

# Scratch files written by coding harnesses during dogfood runs. The harnesses
# execute in their own processes, so the governance gate sees their dispatch
# but not their individual writes — five of these were committed before anyone
# noticed. Ignoring them is not a substitute for reviewing `git status`.
/answer*.txt
/*_check.py
/*_check.txt
/find_*.py
/scratch_*

# OAuth client configuration and credential material. The packaging configs
# already exclude these; git was the one path that did not.
client_secret*.json
credentials.json
token.json
application_default_credentials.json
service-account*.json
service_account*.json

# Test and emulator scratch output. `.firebase-phase5e.json` is real config
# used by tests/emulator/README.md, so it is deliberately not listed here.
.pytest-task*-temp/
coverage.json
ui/approval/coverage/
firestore-debug.log
firestore-*.log
firestore-*.err
infra/gcp/terraform.tfvars
